    },
    {
        "key": "rule_timing_structure_quick_ref",
        "original": "11.1.1. The following pages contain quick reference guides for the main timing structures in the game. When initiating a new timing structure, begin at the first numbered step and proceed through the structure sequentially, unless instructed to move to a different phase or step.",
        "translation": "以下页面包含游戏中主要时序结构的速查指南。当发起一个新的时序结构时，从第一个编号步骤开始，并按顺序依次进行，除非有指示要求移动到其他阶段或步骤。"
    },
    {
        "key": "rule_timing_structure_reference_only",
        "original": "11.1.2. These guides are intended to serve as shorthand references only; for comprehensive rules relating to each timing structure, see the accompanying rules sections.",
        "translation": "这些指南仅作为简写式参考；关于各个时序结构的完整规则，请参阅对应的规则章节。"
    },
